    scene cg julie_field at old_bg

    narrator "........."

    pause 2.2

    scene cg julie_field_2 at old_bg

    narrator "It was some time before Mark realized."

    narrator "The dandelion girl with the straw hat had stopped dancing, and now she was just standing there, staring at Mark with a face like a curious animal."

    narrator "Mark thought:"

    narrator "One time, at a place called Saint Vincent Malleys, he'd seen something like this."

    narrator "It felt like she'd stepped out of the past and stood before him, but... that was wrong."

    narrator "But she'd stepped out of the future... hadn't she...?"


